{"id":"7f7971a17cbe9e6d","group":"72","path":"72/72-df-two-round-no-counterexample-interpretation.md","title":"两轮量词的无反例解释接口","display":"df-two-round-no-counterexample-interpretation — 两轮量词的无反例解释接口","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Handbook of Proof Theory","book_abbrev":"72","label":"72-df-two-round-no-counterexample-interpretation","aliases":["72-df-two-round-no-counterexample-interpretation"],"display":"df-two-round-no-counterexample-interpretation — 两轮量词的无反例解释接口","depends_on":["[[72-df-finite-type-arithmetic]]"],"chapter":"V","source_edition":"Buss (ed.), Handbook of Proof Theory, Elsevier, 1998","source_location":"Ch.V Corollary3.2.6, print354–355/PDF366–367; two-round instance","source_kind":"source-based-local-formalization","verification_status":"source-statement-and-local-contract-reviewed; not-machine-checked","proof_status":"source arity specialization and typed substitution checked","eligible_as_verified_dependency":false,"created":"2026-10-22","revision_round":"2026-10-22-expansion"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Handbook of Proof Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"72"},{"key":"label","html":"72-df-two-round-no-counterexample-interpretation"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>72-df-two-round-no-counterexample-interpretation</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-two-round-no-counterexample-interpretation — 两轮量词的无反例解释接口"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"b4e2c27ac178897e\" href=\"?note=b4e2c27ac178897e\" title=\"72-df-finite-type-arithmetic\">72-df-finite-type-arithmetic</a></span></div>"},{"key":"chapter","html":"V"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"Buss (ed.), Handbook of Proof Theory, Elsevier, 1998"},{"key":"source_location","html":"Ch.V Corollary3.2.6, print354–355/PDF366–367; two-round instance"},{"key":"source_kind","html":"source-based-local-formalization"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"source-statement-and-local-contract-reviewed; not-machine-checked"},{"key":"proof_status","html":"source arity specialization and typed substitution checked"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"false"},{"key":"created","html":"2026-10-22"},{"key":"revision_round","html":"2026-10-22-expansion"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\theta\\in\\mathcal Q\\cap\\mathcal F_{ar}\">\\(\\theta\\in\\mathcal Q\\cap\\mathcal F_{ar}\\)</span>，其自由变量包含于互异的数变量 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x_0,x_1,y_0,y_1\">\\(x_0,x_1,y_0,y_1\\)</span>。另取不同于 θ 全部变量的新鲜变量 a:𝟎、h:𝟎→𝟎。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\zeta:=\\mathsf0\\to(\\mathsf0\\to\\mathsf0)\\to\\mathsf0\">\\(\\zeta:=\\mathsf0\\to(\\mathsf0\\to\\mathsf0)\\to\\mathsf0\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"F_0,F_1\\in\\mathcal T_\\zeta^c\">\\(F_0,F_1\\in\\mathcal T_\\zeta^c\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T_0\">\\(T_0\\)</span>、封闭项及代入取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"b4e2c27ac178897e\" href=\"?note=b4e2c27ac178897e\" title=\"72-df-finite-type-arithmetic\">72-df-finite-type-arithmetic</a>。四个代入项只含 a,h，故以下顺次代入等同于同时代入。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\nu&amp;:=F_0ah,\\qquad v:=F_1ah,\\\\\n\\operatorname{NCmat}(\\theta,F_0,F_1;a,h)&amp;:=\\theta[a/x_0][h(u)/x_1][u/y_0][v/y_1],\\\\\n\\operatorname{NCI}_2(\\theta,F_0,F_1)&amp;:\\Longleftrightarrow T_0\\vdash\\operatorname{NCmat}(\\theta,F_0,F_1;a,h).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\nu&amp;:=F_0ah,\\qquad v:=F_1ah,\\\\\n\\operatorname{NCmat}(\\theta,F_0,F_1;a,h)&amp;:=\\theta[a/x_0][h(u)/x_1][u/y_0][v/y_1],\\\\\n\\operatorname{NCI}_2(\\theta,F_0,F_1)&amp;:\\Longleftrightarrow T_0\\vdash\\operatorname{NCmat}(\\theta,F_0,F_1;a,h).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>a 给第一轮全称变量的值，h 根据第一轮见证提供第二轮挑战。F₀、F₁ 依赖整组反例策略 a,h，不能误写成逐轮普通 Skolem 函数；后一种输出强度一般不同。由于项与公式按 α 类解释且挑战变量均新鲜，改换这些变量不改变可证性资格。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"72-df-finite-type-arithmetic","status":"resolved","id":"b4e2c27ac178897e","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[72-df-finite-type-arithmetic]]","embed":false},{"target":"72-df-finite-type-arithmetic","status":"resolved","id":"b4e2c27ac178897e","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\zeta:=\\mathsf0\\to(\\mathsf0\\to\\mathsf0)\\to\\mathsf0$，$F_0,F_1\\in\\mathcal T_\\zeta^c$。$T_0$、封闭项及代入取 [[72-df-finite-type-arithmetic]]。四个代入项只含 a,h，故以下顺次代入等同于同时代入。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\theta\\in\\mathcal Q\\cap\\mathcal F_{ar}","display":false},{"tex":"x_0,x_1,y_0,y_1","display":false},{"tex":"\\zeta:=\\mathsf0\\to(\\mathsf0\\to\\mathsf0)\\to\\mathsf0","display":false},{"tex":"F_0,F_1\\in\\mathcal T_\\zeta^c","display":false},{"tex":"T_0","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\nu&:=F_0ah,\\qquad v:=F_1ah,\\\\\n\\operatorname{NCmat}(\\theta,F_0,F_1;a,h)&:=\\theta[a/x_0][h(u)/x_1][u/y_0][v/y_1],\\\\\n\\operatorname{NCI}_2(\\theta,F_0,F_1)&:\\Longleftrightarrow T_0\\vdash\\operatorname{NCmat}(\\theta,F_0,F_1;a,h).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true}],"bytes":1921,"backlinks":[{"id":"e6c99e2646691c7d","anchor":"ref-132","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"V章新增5项：[[72-df-finite-type-choice-principles]] · [[72-df-two-round-no-counterexample-interpretation]] · [[72-ex-dialectica-markov-matrix]] · [[72-ex-dialectica-quantifier-free-choice]] · [[72-thm-two-round-no-counterexample]]"},{"id":"00439897fb